---
import panelImage from '../assets/panel.png';

---

<section
  class="bg-gray-100 flex flex-col items-center py-12 px-6 gap-6
md:py-16 md:px-12 md:flex-row md:justify-around md:gap-10
xl:py-20 xl:px-30 xl:gap-16"
>
  <picture>
    <img src={panelImage.src} alt="Unified control plane" />
  </picture>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-140
    xl:gap-6 xl:max-w-1/2">
    <h3
      class="font-syne font-bold text-xl text-dark-surface
        md:text-2xl
        xl:text-3xl"
    >
      Unified control plane across all clouds
    </h3>
    <p
      class="font-geist  text-xs text-secondary
        md:text-sm
        xl:text-base"
    >
      Run workloads wherever your users are. AuraFlow aggregates AWS, GCP, and
      bare-metal enclaves into a single seamless logical namespace.
    </p>
    <ul class="hidden
        xl:flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-secondary">
      <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <span
          ><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14.1991 6.33561C14.5036 7.8298 14.2866 9.38322 13.5843 10.7368C12.8821 12.0904 11.737 13.1623 10.3401 13.7738C8.9432 14.3853 7.37886 14.4995 5.90797 14.0972C4.43709 13.6949 3.14857 12.8005 2.25729 11.5632C1.36601 10.3259 0.925853 8.82043 1.01021 7.29786C1.09458 5.77529 1.69836 4.32767 2.72087 3.19639C3.74339 2.06511 5.12283 1.31856 6.62915 1.08124C8.13547 0.843922 9.67763 1.13018 10.9984 1.89227M5.66536 7.00195L7.66536 9.00195L14.332 2.33529" stroke="#4F46E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
</svg>

        </span><p>Multi-cloud failover routed dynamically in &#60; 15ms</p>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <span
          ><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14.1991 6.33561C14.5036 7.8298 14.2866 9.38322 13.5843 10.7368C12.8821 12.0904 11.737 13.1623 10.3401 13.7738C8.9432 14.3853 7.37886 14.4995 5.90797 14.0972C4.43709 13.6949 3.14857 12.8005 2.25729 11.5632C1.36601 10.3259 0.925853 8.82043 1.01021 7.29786C1.09458 5.77529 1.69836 4.32767 2.72087 3.19639C3.74339 2.06511 5.12283 1.31856 6.62915 1.08124C8.13547 0.843922 9.67763 1.13018 10.9984 1.89227M5.66536 7.00195L7.66536 9.00195L14.332 2.33529" stroke="#4F46E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
</svg>

        </span><p>No vendor lock-in with unified container runtime standards</p>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
        <span
          ><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14.1991 6.33561C14.5036 7.8298 14.2866 9.38322 13.5843 10.7368C12.8821 12.0904 11.737 13.1623 10.3401 13.7738C8.9432 14.3853 7.37886 14.4995 5.90797 14.0972C4.43709 13.6949 3.14857 12.8005 2.25729 11.5632C1.36601 10.3259 0.925853 8.82043 1.01021 7.29786C1.09458 5.77529 1.69836 4.32767 2.72087 3.19639C3.74339 2.06511 5.12283 1.31856 6.62915 1.08124C8.13547 0.843922 9.67763 1.13018 10.9984 1.89227M5.66536 7.00195L7.66536 9.00195L14.332 2.33529" stroke="#4F46E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
</svg>

        </span><p>Encrypted snapshot replication across active backbones</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <a class="button-primary md:w-fit text-center" href="">Explore Multicloud Docs</a>
  </div>
</section>
